
# <type>(<scope>): <summary — imperative, lower case, no period, max 72 chars>
#
# Why is this change needed? What does it do? Wrap lines at 72 chars.
#
# Refs: FR-W2, #12      (requirement IDs from the design doc, issue numbers)
# Closes #12            (closes the issue when merged)
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# type:  feat     new behaviour the user can see
#        fix      bug fix
#        test     adding or fixing tests only
#        docs     documentation only
#        style    formatting, layouts, colours (no logic change)
#        refactor code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
#        perf     performance
#        build    Gradle, dependencies
#        ci       GitHub Actions
#        chore    housekeeping, releases, version bumps
#
# scope: core | data | domain | watchlist | portfolio | details | alerts
#        worker | ui | demo | release
#
# Examples:
#   feat(watchlist): add swipe/remove with 4-second undo and alert warning
#   fix(alerts): open Stock Details from notification on Android 14
#   chore(release): set version 1.0.0 (versionCode 1)
# Lines starting with # are ignored.

